SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout at the Pence Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Pence Gallery in Davis for our 2nd Friday ArtAbout reception on October 9\, 6-9 PM. Enjoy browsing all new exhibits\, complimentary wine\, and an art-themed scavenger hunt. Free admission! \n  \nPortraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nThis series features Gioia Fonda’s new paintings of arrangements of toys and found objects\, alongside paintings by her advisor Charlie Gill based on her past still-life photographs. \n  \nMercy Hawkins: Waltz of Life & Limb | Oct. 3 – Nov. 6\, 2026  \nPairing her sculptural paintings and vibrant\, large-scale watercolors on paper\, Mercy Hawkins’ biomorphic shapes speak to a sensory play of color\, light\, and movement. Her imagery evokes seed pods\, flower buds\, or microscopic creatures.  \n  \nDanilo Campos: Out and About | Oct. 9 – Nov. 29\, 2026 \nDanilo Campos’ paintings explore his love of new places and experiences\, reflecting his way of seeming to mindlessly go ‘out and about\,’ but coming back with gems of resources. \n  \nMisuk Goltz’s Class: Expressive Watercolor | Oct. 2 – Nov. 15\, 2026 \nThis stairway show illustrates what Misuk Goltz’s watercolor students have achieved during the course of her workshops and reflects the community of painting\, encouragement\, and friendship that she has fostered while teaching at the Pence since 2020.  \n  \nScavenger Hunt: Join us for a fun\, art-themed scavenger hunt at the Pence during the 2nd Friday ArtAbout. Complete all of the clues by exploring our exhibits for the chance to win a special prize. \n  \n— \n  \nVisit the Pence and other venues in Downtown Davis for the 2nd Friday ArtAbout art walk. We will have printed ArtAbout guides available that week. Follow the ArtAbout’s Facebook page for more information: https://www.facebook.com/davisartabout. \n  \nImages: \nGioia Fonda\, “Holding It Together” \nMercy Hawkins\, “Melting Ice” \nDanilo Campos\, “Sunday Market” \nFrances Burke\, “Star Gazer”
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/2nd-friday-artabout-at-the-pence-gallery-20/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Pence-Reception-Banners-1-2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
